<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
<title>CavernaQuest — Jogos e outras obsessões</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@500;700;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --stone-950:#0e0c0a;
    --stone-900:#171310;
    --stone-800:#231c16;
    --wood-700:#3a2a1c;
    --wood-600:#4d3822;
    --teal:#2fd8c9;
    --teal-dim:#1f8f85;
    --gold:#e9b64c;
    --gold-dim:#a67c2e;
    --cream:#f1e8d6;
    --cream-dim:#c9bfab;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
    padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
  }
  *{box-sizing:inherit;}
  html{scroll-padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px); height:100%;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    min-height:100%;
    color:var(--cream);
    font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;
    position:relative;
  }
  .bg-image{
    position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:-2;
    background-image:url("data:image/jpeg;base64,");
    background-size:cover;
    background-position:center 30%;
    background-repeat:no-repeat;
  }
  .bg-scrim{
    position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:-1;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,8,6,0.15) 0%, rgba(10,8,6,0.35) 38%, rgba(10,8,6,0.82) 62%, rgba(10,8,6,0.96) 100%);
  }

  .spacer{height:min(72vh, 560px);}

  .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px 0;}

  .lead{
    text-align:center;
    padding:0 12px 22px;
  }
  .lead .eyebrow{
    font-family:'Cinzel',serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:0.95rem;
    letter-spacing:0.06em;
    color:var(--gold);
    margin:0;
    animation:fade-up 0.6s ease both;
  }
  .lead p{
    margin:6px 0 0;
    color:var(--cream-dim);
    font-size:0.92rem;
    animation:fade-up 0.6s ease 0.08s both;
  }
  @keyframes fade-up{
    from{opacity:0; transform:translateY(10px);}
    to{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);}
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .card, .lead .eyebrow, .lead p{animation:none !important;}
  }

  /* link cards */
  .links{
    padding:0 20px 4px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:13px;
  }
  .card{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:16px;
    padding:15px 17px;
    border-radius:13px;
    background:linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(35,28,22,0.82), rgba(20,16,12,0.86));
    backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
    border:1px solid rgba(233,182,76,0.18);
    text-decoration:none;
    color:var(--cream);
    position:relative;
    isolation:isolate;
    overflow:hidden;
    transition:transform 0.18s ease, border-color 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease;
    animation:fade-up 0.5s ease both;
  }
  .card:nth-child(1){animation-delay:0.05s;}
  .card:nth-child(2){animation-delay:0.10s;}
  .card:nth-child(3){animation-delay:0.15s;}
  .card:nth-child(4){animation-delay:0.20s;}
  .card:nth-child(5){animation-delay:0.25s;}
  .card:nth-child(6){animation-delay:0.30s;}
  .card::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;inset:0;
    background:linear-gradient(120deg, transparent, rgba(47,216,201,0.12), transparent);
    transform:translateX(-120%);
    transition:transform 0.5s ease;
    z-index:-1;
  }
  .card:hover, .card:focus-visible{
    transform:translateY(-2px);
    border-color:rgba(47,216,201,0.5);
    box-shadow:0 10px 28px -12px rgba(47,216,201,0.4), 0 0 0 1px rgba(233,182,76,0.14);
  }
  .card:hover::before{transform:translateX(120%);}
  .card:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--teal); outline-offset:2px;}
  .icon-box{
    flex:none;
    width:44px;height:44px;
    border-radius:10px;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    background:rgba(77,56,34,0.9);
    border:1px solid rgba(233,182,76,0.25);
  }
  .icon-box svg{width:23px;height:23px;fill:var(--cream);}
  .card-text{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;min-width:0;}
  .card-plat{
    font-family:'Cinzel',serif;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:0.7rem;
    letter-spacing:0.16em;
    color:var(--gold);
  }
  .card-handle{
    font-size:0.98rem;
    font-weight:600;
    color:var(--cream);
    white-space:nowrap;
    overflow:hidden;
    text-overflow:ellipsis;
  }
  .card-arrow{margin-left:auto;flex:none;color:var(--teal-dim);transition:transform 0.18s ease, color 0.18s ease;}
  .card:hover .card-arrow{transform:translateX(3px);color:var(--teal);}
  .shop-card{border-color:rgba(233,182,76,0.4); background:linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(42,32,19,0.86), rgba(20,16,12,0.88));}
  .shop-card .icon-box{background:rgba(166,124,46,0.9);}
  .shop-card:hover{border-color:var(--gold); box-shadow:0 10px 28px -12px rgba(233,182,76,0.45);}
  .shop-card:hover .card-arrow{color:var(--gold);}

  footer{
    padding:36px 20px 44px;
    text-align:center;
  }
  footer .divider{
    width:60px;height:2px;
    margin:0 auto 16px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold), transparent);
    opacity:0.6;
  }
  footer p{margin:2px 0; font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--cream-dim);}
  footer .brand-line{font-family:'Cinzel',serif; letter-spacing:0.14em; color:var(--gold); font-size:0.78rem;}

  @media (max-width:420px){
    .spacer{height:52vh;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="bg-image" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="bg-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<div class="spacer"></div>

<div class="wrap">

  <div class="lead">
    <p class="eyebrow">Entra na Caverna.</p>
    <p>Escolhe teu caminho e segue a quest.</p>
  </div>

  <main class="links" aria-label="Links do CavernaQuest">

